error[SC0009]: `q` is not a valid numeric literal suffix
  --> tests/ui/invalid_numeric_suffix.science:10:22
   |
10 |     let counted be 42q
   |                      ^ unknown suffix
   |
   = note: the suffixes are `i8`, `i16`, `i32`, `i64`, `u8`, `u16`, `u32`, `u64`, `f32` and `f64`

error[SC0009]: `i32` is not a valid suffix for a float literal
  --> tests/ui/invalid_numeric_suffix.science:11:21
   |
11 |     let ratio be 2.5i32
   |                     ^^^ invalid suffix
   |
   = note: float literals only take `f32` or `f64`
